Related independent work
  Nic Limper (https://github.com/nlimper) worked on the JD7601 Spectra 6 controller in a separate, parallel project.
  Several results here build on his findings and reviews (end hold, the 799/800 B layout, codec and level-map
  cross-checks, codes 4/7 on the JD7601, and ideas we tested); see "Acknowledgements" in README.md.
  All measurements are ours. Nothing in this repository is copied from that project.

